-- title:
--   Base change of the X₁-chart of the projective Weierstrass model is cartesian
-- statement:
--   Let $R$ be a commutative ring, $W$ a Weierstrass curve over $R$, and $K$ a commutative ring equipped with an $R$-algebra structure, all in a fixed universe. Write $B_R = \mathrm{MvPolynomial}\,(\mathrm{Fin}\,3)\,R/(F)$, where $F$ is the homogeneous cubic `W.toProjective.polynomial`, graded by $n \mapsto$ the image in the quotient of the submodule of homogeneous polynomials of degree $n$, and likewise $B_K$ for the base-changed curve `W.map (algebraMap R K)`. The statement first introduces the graded ring homomorphism $\psi : B_R \to B_K$ obtained from coefficientwise application of $R \to K$: it is well defined because the image of $(F)$ under `MvPolynomial.map (algebraMap R K)` is the ideal generated by the cubic of the base-changed curve, and it respects the gradings since coefficientwise maps preserve homogeneity. Let $x$ denote the class of the variable `X 1` in $B_R$. The assertion is that the square of affine schemes with top edge $\operatorname{Spec}$ of the induced map $(B_R)_{(x)} \to (B_K)_{(\psi x)}$ of degree-zero parts of the localisations at the powers of $x$ and of $\psi x$, vertical edges $\operatorname{Spec}$ of the structure maps $K \to (B_K)_0 \to (B_K)_{(\psi x)}$ and $R \to (B_R)_0 \to (B_R)_{(x)}$, and bottom edge $\operatorname{Spec}(R \to K)$, is a pullback square in schemes.
--
--   This is the affine-local form of base change for the projective Weierstrass model: the $X_1$-chart $D_+(X_1)$ of the model of the base-changed curve is the fibre product of the $X_1$-chart over $\operatorname{Spec} R$ with $\operatorname{Spec} K$, equivalently $(B_K)_{(\psi X_1)} \cong K \otimes_R (B_R)_{(X_1)}$. It feeds the chart-by-chart construction of the base-change pullback square for the whole projective model, [`WeierstrassProjModel.projModel_isPullback_baseChange`](thm.html#WeierstrassProjModel.projModel_isPullback_baseChange) and [`WeierstrassProjModel.projModel_isPullback_baseChange_ring`](thm.html#WeierstrassProjModel.projModel_isPullback_baseChange_ring), and is used in [`WeierstrassCurve.DrinfeldGlobal.isPullback_projMap_of_isCoefficientHom`](thm.html#WeierstrassCurve.DrinfeldGlobal.isPullback_projMap_of_isCoefficientHom).
-- source:
